==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Once the stage begins, immediately begin to spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow]]/[[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe]] [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]]. This should beat the [[Metal Hippoe]] very easily. Don't use cats like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], because every hit on Metal Hippoe only does one damage.

This stage can be made easier by bringing along any fast attacking cats you have, such as [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]], or bringing along units with the [[Critical Hit]] ability such as [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]] and/or [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]].

